WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.660
An exam page.

2
00:00:01.710 --> 00:00:05.470
A line about Scrooge:
"secret, and self-contained,

3
00:00:05.520 --> 00:00:07.790
and solitary as an oyster".

4
00:00:07.840 --> 00:00:11.500
Under it, a student
writes: "This is a simile."

5
00:00:11.550 --> 00:00:14.540
In the corner, a counter barely moves.

6
00:00:14.590 --> 00:00:16.310
So they add more labels.

7
00:00:16.360 --> 00:00:17.560
Sibilance.

8
00:00:17.610 --> 00:00:18.620
A list.

9
00:00:18.670 --> 00:00:21.100
The counter still barely twitches.

10
00:00:21.150 --> 00:00:25.380
If naming the technique isn't enough,
what would make that counter climb?

11
00:00:25.430 --> 00:00:29.300
In this mission, you'll put
spotting and analysing side by side,

12
00:00:29.350 --> 00:00:31.770
and find out what the second one adds.

13
00:00:31.820 --> 00:00:33.750
Is a sharper label the answer?

14
00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:36.800
Or the meaning, put into
your own plain words?

15
00:00:36.850 --> 00:00:39.910
And you'll rank three answers
on Scrooge in Stave 1,

16
00:00:39.960 --> 00:00:43.040
from flint to frost, the
way an examiner would.

17
00:00:43.090 --> 00:00:46.300
Your mission: work out
what makes it analysis.
